# Developer overrides. Nothing here is needed: people set Domo up in the app
# (the setup guide and each settings page), `pnpm dev` defaults to the
# development stack, and an installed Domo has no .env at all. A variable set
# here wins over the value saved in the app. docs/configuration.md lists them.
#
# Another Postgres and Electric than the development stack's (54321, 30000).
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:password@localhost:54321/domo
# ELECTRIC_URL=http://localhost:30000
#
# Where uploads, models and voices are kept. Default ./.data
# NUXT_DATA_DIR=
